=====================================================================
YOUR WEB PAGE — DESIGN REFERENCE (single file, not production code)
=====================================================================
PURPOSE
  Visual and content reference for the real website. Rebuild it in
  Next.js + Tailwind CSS. Match the look, layout, copy tone and page
  structure. Do not copy the hash-router; use real routes.

COMPANY FACTS (use exactly)
  Brand ........ Your Web Page        Domain ... yourwebpage.ca
  Email ........ hello@yourwebpage.ca Phone .... (902) 629-9691
  Location ..... Charlottetown, Prince Edward Island (no street address)
  Reach ........ Serves PEI, the rest of Canada and clients worldwide
                 (remote-first; in person around Charlottetown)
  Legal ........ Your Web Page is a trade name of NightTech Services Inc.

DESIGN SYSTEM
  Colour ....... #000 and #fff, ONE grey (#595959) for secondary text
                 on white, and ONE accent: orange #ff6a00. Orange is for
                 primary buttons, highlights, bullets and the quote
                 mark, always with BLACK text on top. Never set orange
                 text on white (poor contrast).
  Shape ........ Boxes only. 2px solid black borders, square corners.
                 No border-radius, no box-shadow, no gradients.
  Grids ........ Cells share 2px borders (grid gap 2px on a black
                 background). Incomplete last rows are filled with
                 hatched "filler" cells.
  Type ......... Archivo (heavy, uppercase headings, tight tracking)
                 + JetBrains Mono (labels, tags, buttons, metadata).
  Interaction .. Hover and focus INVERT a box (black bg, white text),
                 150ms. No other decorative motion.
  Placeholders . Black/white SVG pattern boxes instead of photos.

PAGES (17 + detail pages + 404)
  /  /about  /services  /services/web-design  /services/web-development
  /services/ecommerce  /services/saas-software  /services/care-support
  /our-work  /our-work/[slug]  /process  /where-we-work
  /resources  /resources/[slug]  /faq  /contact  /start-a-project
  /privacy  /terms  + custom 404

RULES
  No pricing anywhere. No "blog" (it is "Resources"). No invented
  client logos, awards or statistics. Projects shown here are SAMPLE
  placeholders, flagged on the page; replace with real work.
  Testimonials are EMPTY PLACEHOLDER SLOTS. Render a testimonial only
  when it is a real quote the client has approved; hide empty slots.
  The home page also carries a Testimonials section and a short FAQ.
=====================================================================
-->

